    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u06/listening-01.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u06/listening-01.wav",
      "script": "パンとみずは、あります。おにぎりは、ありません。パンがすきです。ひるごはんは、パンにします。パンをください。",
      "sha256": "9d7a8c2fab2b65f42979120f9a2b1c42f1164f9da5535be9bac153066a35255a",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u06/listening-02.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u06/listening-02.wav",
      "script": "あさごはんは、パンです。のみものは、ぎゅうにゅうです。ぎゅうにゅうをください。",
      "sha256": "1119b75a7ddd62d862bb49a8c78b21823764f415196a7473babf0fdacd3603af",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u06/listening-03.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u06/listening-03.wav",
      "script": "わたしは、さかながすきです。きょうは、さかなをたべません。にくをたべます。",
      "sha256": "57ed7f214b73c05ab33ef97d71cac88c23d18b4cba96bbc7cb1c3e1dde67a7ec",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u06/listening-04.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u06/listening-04.wav",
      "script": "あには、りんごがすきです。わたしは、バナナがすきです。あねは、りんごがきらいです。",
      "sha256": "e0c5ba8a316ecf9c0b0b57c31719cb1a85cfe66fc65919a04d6719a3beea46ee",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u06/listening-05.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u06/listening-05.wav",
      "script": "しょくどうで、ものをたのみます。いちばん。みずをください。にばん。パンをください。さんばん。スープをください。よんばん。ぎゅうにゅうをください。",
      "sha256": "b8c2f37ac7e34b3a875f185ac962cf9551060513f06dca70e7a6e5d313231936",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u06/listening-06.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u06/listening-06.wav",
      "script": "なにをたべますか。",
      "sha256": "97d0d66f4add5e741f20225200e3b2eca329dcdb9d5a972b565f544a668fe45b",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u06/U06-teach-words-1.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u06/U06-teach-words-1.wav",
      "script": "ごはん。パン。みず。おちゃ。ぎゅうにゅう。",
      "sha256": "4afca02a8fb6434fa88a5ada1d6d852591f4df88c78037cd0b5327375c79309d",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u06/U06-teach-words-2.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u06/U06-teach-words-2.wav",
      "script": "ジュース。にく。さかな。やさい。くだもの。",
      "sha256": "5d9180217a78310dcaa3f6a1e760110d7a850102e52be4bf04b09e8fa7294d44",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u06/U06-teach-words-3.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u06/U06-teach-words-3.wav",
      "script": "りんご。バナナ。たまご。スープ。カレー。",
      "sha256": "82a4bfed9b6b7b66f0d102ab54497b74c0d202d2f6a90fd40d02b1e9ff9af8d4",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u06/U06-teach-words-4.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u06/U06-teach-words-4.wav",
      "script": "うどん。おにぎり。サラダ。おべんとう。あさごはん。",
      "sha256": "fadee114f505b8fabc5f1fd2a1bc04e5ffbb80192ad1e4053d102ed7faaa0f45",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u06/U06-teach-words-5.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u06/U06-teach-words-5.wav",
      "script": "ひるごはん。ばんごはん。すき。きらい。ください。",
      "sha256": "c37b62af5969ea5e2c86f4a924a6f820a78cd1ba769dc0fc3b56efd8066dae43",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u06/U06-teach-kanji.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u06/U06-teach-kanji.wav",
      "script": "たべます。のみます。みず。さかな。にく。さかなをたべます。みずをのみます。",
      "sha256": "82d5b4ba7df6415d5b5f2886e6611930aef25296827ee6c24723c5bbbff91006",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u06/U06-teach-G16.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u06/U06-teach-G16.wav",
      "script": "パンをたべます。みずをのみます。さかなはたべません。なにをたべますか。おにぎりをたべます。",
      "sha256": "276d2c814d4131c9b120c86f58700274ce6e808ed8f6cd0a94a3e9e14fda101d",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u06/U06-teach-G17.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u06/U06-teach-G17.wav",
      "script": "りんごがすきです。バナナがきらいです。ひとによって、すきなものはちがいます。",
      "sha256": "8a2b2e666f2f6bb811bf5008f1e6c3d92abb2b8e986b5a574f95bdca8144c35f",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
